{:coverage/id "kotoba-property-authority-coverage"
 :coverage/version "0.1.0"
 :coverage/default-status :unknown
 :coverage/statuses #{:allow-login-free :governed-license :search-only :deny :unknown}
 :coverage/entries
 [{:authority/id "GLOBAL/GLEIF"
   :jurisdiction "GLOBAL"
   :authority "Global Legal Entity Identifier Foundation"
   :dataset "LEI Level 1 and Level 2"
   :status :allow-login-free
   :property-owner-data? false
   :natural-person-ubo-data? false
   :url "https://api.gleif.org/api/v1/lei-records"
   :bulk-url "https://goldencopy.gleif.org/api/v2/golden-copies/publishes"
   :bulk-licence "CC0 1.0"
   :reviewed-at "2026-08-01"
   :note "Two endpoints of one authority: the paginated API for lookups, and the
          daily Golden Copy full file for the whole universe (3,391,413 records
          on 2026-08-01). Same publisher, same CC0 terms, no account. Corporate
          identity only -- no natural-person data, so DATA-GOVERNANCE.md's UBO
          restrictions do not apply to it."}
  {:authority/id "JP/NTA-Houjin-Bangou"
   :jurisdiction "JP"
   :authority "国税庁 (National Tax Agency)"
   :dataset "法人番号 基本3情報 (商号・所在地・法人番号)"
   :status :allow-login-free
   :property-owner-data? false
   :natural-person-ubo-data? false
   :url "https://www.houjin-bangou.nta.go.jp/"
   :bulk-url "https://www.houjin-bangou.nta.go.jp/download/zenken/"
   :bulk-licence "公共データ利用規約（第1.0版）"
   :attribution "出典：国税庁法人番号公表サイト（国税庁）https://www.houjin-bangou.nta.go.jp/download/zenken/ を加工して作成"
   :reviewed-at "2026-08-18"
   :note "Two endpoints of one authority, and only one of them is an ingest
          path. The Web-API (api.houjin-bangou.nta.go.jp, used by
          cloud-itonami-isic-8291) answers one company at a time and needs an
          Application ID the NTA issues to a named operator over ~2-4 weeks;
          the 全件データ download needs no account at all -- one POST of the
          page's session token and a file number. 5,816,535 rows on the
          2026-07-31 publish. 法人番号 is issued to legal entities and
          unincorporated associations, never to a sole proprietor, so the file
          carries no natural-person data and DATA-GOVERNANCE.md's UBO
          restrictions do not apply to it. The licence is not CC0: attribution
          is required and a derived work must say it is derived."}
  {:authority/id "JP/NTA-Invoice"
   :jurisdiction "JP"
   :authority "国税庁 (National Tax Agency)"
   :dataset "適格請求書発行事業者公表事項 (invoice registry)"
   :status :allow-login-free
   :property-owner-data? false
   :natural-person-ubo-data? false
   :natural-person-data? :individual-registrants-only
   :url "https://www.invoice-kohyo.nta.go.jp/"
   :bulk-url "https://www.invoice-kohyo.nta.go.jp/download/zenken"
   :bulk-licence "公共データ利用規約（第1.0版）"
   :attribution "出典：国税庁適格請求書発行事業者公表サイト（国税庁）https://www.invoice-kohyo.nta.go.jp/download/zenken を加工して作成"
   :reviewed-at "2026-08-18"
   :note "A second NTA site, and a different rule from JP/NTA-Houjin-Bangou.
          法人 and 人格のない社団等 rows carry `T` + 法人番号 and no
          natural-person data -- they join to the corporate registry and may be
          projected. 個人 rows are a natural person's name (plus trading name
          and address where the registrant asked for publication): collectable
          to a node-local corpus for a lookup, never committed to `data/` and
          never loaded onto the shared query plane. That split is enforced by
          `invoice-zenken/projectable?`, not only by this note. Monthly publish,
          one GET per split, no account."}
  {:authority/id "US-NY-NYC/NYC-OpenData"
   :jurisdiction "US-NY-NYC"
